  "owner": "pa31 source Unsize for projected sized subjects",
  "contract": "Predicted complete source/LowIR, independent object and native outcomes are frozen before implementation or oracle generation. A source projection with a known dyn target generates the full existing Sized, principal, equality, auto, outlives and endpoint formation obligations. It grants no physical shape or equality. Known dyn sources retain intrinsic upcast evidence; unknown/failed planning cannot publish unpaid absence. Raw inference/normalization/property fences remain unchanged. Three separately required generic tuple-factory positives remain explicit cleanup-owner requirements. Active intrinsic-field sources construct the same tuple aggregate with a struct literal, preserving the exact projected-field borrowing proof without demanding a separate factory body.",
